WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:35.530
Passing Through The Night

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:46.540
I used my power before other people's eyes.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.420
What'll happen now?

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.930
Christmas!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.240
It was the GPO who were after me.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.710
I'm sorry, Christmas.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.960
Why do you apologize?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.380
Because we can't sleep in our beds tonight.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:47.180
I don't mind. I've never been to a
place like this, so it's sorta fun.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.600
And there are lots of people.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.360
My car broke down. And boy,
I had such a hard time!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.940
It took so long!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.980
I'll have the tart.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.150
I'll have the same.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.700
I see.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.240
And Kurau...

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.490
You're here, too.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.290
We can go to our new house tomorrow.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.750
So let's stay here in this town for a while. Just the two of us.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.420
Yeah.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.970
Yeah. That's right!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.930
Neither of them were caught!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.480
Like I said, they literally flew the coop!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.770
I've never seen a flight apparatus like that!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.400
Just what is she?!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.490
You're a Broker! Didn't you get any data?!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.530
Missing?!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.360
The client?!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.830
I can't get hold of my partner either!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.580
Just what kind of job is this?!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.580
If you want me to work for you, don't hide anything!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.300
I can't take this any more!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.660
I can't take this...

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.550
All right.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.050
This is great, really great!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:51.180
Seriously I'm so glad you came, Kurau!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.100
There's such a dearth of skilled people these days.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.520
Well, excuse me!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.650
No, you're valuable, Sam.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.520
What happened over there?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.030
Nothing!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.780
Just a little run-in with the GPO.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.240
Right, Kurau?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.950
Just a little.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.660
It happens a lot.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:14.460
And you need a sharp Broker like me
to smooth things over.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.460
Yeah, right.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.880
Now what do you need?
I'll get everything ready for you.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.460
First, a room, right?
For your little sister and yourself?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:29.470
Geez... she's embarrassing me!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:34.390
And also... a policeman's club and a pistol.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.430
I don't need a pistol.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.350
What? You brought one?

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.770
It's not that... It's...

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:44.190
But I doubt that I can take on work
that will upset the GPO for a while.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.700
Oh come on, don't kid me!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.700
There's a job that's a bit touchy.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.160
Well, it's just getting back some stolen artifacts.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.670
They're smuggled goods,
so they can't report it to the GPO.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:01.710
The thieves belong to a group headed by
a rich guy's good-for-nothing son.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.960
He's a bad egg who steals just for the fun of it.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:09.050
But lately, they've even started arming pods.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.560
Carradine, I'll take that job.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.310
But...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.560
I can call my partner.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.060
And you need to settle down with your little sister first.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.020
Thanks, Sam.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.030
Thank you.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.280
You're welcome.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.170
Yay!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.340
You brought it?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.050
Yes.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.390
You still haven't been able to contact Dad?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.980
No...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:05.520
But... if he hears that the GPO are after us, Dad may be shocked.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:11.320
You're right. He'll be shocked.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.370
It's all right, Christmas.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.080
You don't have to worry about anything.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:31.180
She's not registered? A Class-A Ryna sapien?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:37.680
Your unit's failure to capture her last night
demonstrated for the first time how strong she is.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.180
I beg your pardon!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.480
With Class C capabilities, my unit
could not be expected to fight...

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.690
I understand.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.980
This was a miscalculation from our Class A strategy team.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.860
Of course, that's not the reason I pulled you out.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:56.410
I trust that you have fully critiqued my work until today.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.370
Detective Ayaka...

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.370
I want you to begin searching for this
Ryna sapien immediately.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.960
Yes, sir!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.040
Excuse me!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.420
Thank you!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:15.470
An Agent will hide among Agents.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.640
It was an easy task.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.600
Then you'll give me a discount, right?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.730
But it's been a long while since we've met.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.450
Is everything taken care of with your divorce?

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.820
Yes.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.320
That ice cream must taste bitter.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.030
Leave me alone.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.040
Oh, by the way...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.620
I heard an interesting rumor.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.380
Rumor?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.420
Hey! Ayaka!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.310
How've you been, Ayaka?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.850
Do you have any orange juice?

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.770
Hey, come on! I wanted to drink with you!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.480
I'm still on duty.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.650
You're so upright as usual.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.150
But that's right, you became a detective, I hear.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.490
Congratulations.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.950
That was long ago.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.910
Just what do you want?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.450
Former detective Doug?

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.700
I just wanted to drink...

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.960
with my dear, former subordinate.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.960
Have reached the hideout.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.460
No sign of the guys.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.510
Just like the data we got.
Okay, I'll wait for you at the site.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:40.350
Roger that. Once I verify the goods, I will contact you.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.400
This is...

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.160
No way! It was worth four-hundred million!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.910
What happened? Did you find it?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.240
This collection is cancelled.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.410
What?!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.170
So you're the trash collector?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.420
Thanks for coming.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.760
Who'd have thought the chairs would be delivered first?

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.850
They look kind of sad.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.770
The table will come tomorrow, right?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.020
They're not sad.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.730
Because there's two of them.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.030
Who is this?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.290
Kurau, help me!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.500
Sam's been captured by those guys!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.830
I understand. I'll just go over there, right?

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.090
The man who went in my place...

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.260
You mean, Sam?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.930
I have to go rescue him.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.270
If I go, I'll end up using my power again.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.280
Kurau, what are you thinking?

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.110
We may not be able to stay here long either.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.950
Kurau!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.580
Talk to me, too!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.670
Kurau, you're always thinking.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.580
Tell me, too.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.460
And I'll think with you!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:42.720
Thank you.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.430
I'm going. I'll do what I can.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.100
So wait for me, Christmas.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.900
Yes.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.150
I understand.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.440
You can go on to bed. I'll be right back.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.650
Be right back!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.500
I've been meaning to ask...

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.630
Why did you leave the GPO?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.340
I got tired of acting only on orders.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.680
And Agents never need to take orders?

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.850
I heard...

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.230
That you're an Agent now.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.190
I have a bit more freedom as an Agent.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.610
A bit more.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:48.660
Say... Don't you think it would be great
to be able to fly freely through the air?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.790
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.870
If you have nothing else, I'm going back.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.250
I heard a very strange rumor.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:13:00.500
That you're after some guys with special powers.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.590
What is this about?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.340
I wonder what that power is...

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.300
Maybe something like flying through the air?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.060
Who is saying such a thing?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.560
It's just a rumor!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.020
Something like that can't be true, right?

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.320
But I'm glad I got to see you.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:25.030
Next time, let's meet when you can have a drink.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:25.860
Okay?

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.390
What'll we do with him?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.430
His partner will come to save him in time,

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.810
so we're gonna play with him a bit.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.900
Oh, that's nice.

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:02.610
I've had a lotta stress lately.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.150
What the...

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.490
No one invited you in!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.990
Then why don't you get an intercom?

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.830
Cut it out. She's a woman.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.750
You're their leader?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:22.960
Black.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:28.470
Black, you're remodeling pods, aren't you?

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.930
Will you sell me parts for this?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:37.230
Hey, hey! We're just students.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.810
From a good school.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:43.270
Rich and smart. You boys are famous...

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.940
They say you can do anything.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:48.820
Then you must know.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.910
We're plain tired of this kind of thing.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.580
It's okay.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.710
Come on in.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.000
Wow, this is amazing!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.420
Hey, can I ride one of them?

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.220
Before that, I want to test something.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.430
Whether you're his partner or not.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:19.980
Shoot him.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.070
Kurau...

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.530
Come home soon...

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.750
Sure.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.550
Hey, isn't this bad?

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.550
What's bad about it?

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.400
Hm?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.320
A blank barrel?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.780
I like you! Want to join us?

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.660
That sounds good, too.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.490
Come on over and drink a toast.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.870
Gene, throw him in the cellar.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.050
Whatever, I don't care.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.090
And my old man...

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:35.890
Where's the bathroom?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.980
Things are going too smoothly.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.520
I don't like it.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.070
Sam, are you all right?

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.280
Let's hurry.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.450
They have something up their sleeves.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.450
You're right.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.490
But it ends here.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:03.830
You're alone?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.130
Won't Black scold you?

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.090
Just who are you?

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.300
When you pulled that trigger earlier,

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.260
I realized that you're...

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.850
Not normal!

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.520
That's rude.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.690
Hey, you're awesome.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.030
Let's go.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.620
Good morning, Go. How do you feel?

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.250
It's not nice to steal a march on others.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.830
She dumped you, eh?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.840
Shut up!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:56.260
Go, watch how we hunt.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.350
Keep on running!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.110
Sam!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:21.740
Kurau!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.060
Dammit!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.410
Keep running.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.350
Ah! Hurry and put out the flames!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.820
This is bad! We better get away from here!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.950
Why... am I so tired?

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.660
Kurau... Kurau...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.910
Kurau...

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.090
It ain't over yet!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.180
Make a fool of me, will you?!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.890
Die!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.270
What happened to me?

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.440
Christmas...

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.000
Kurau?!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:15.670
Kurau!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:22.210
I was a little late.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.760
Kurau...

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.180
I'm so glad!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.180
I'm so glad you're back!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.700
No! No! No!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.460
Christmas!

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.960
Lost Child
